UID:7X0XS6cH6s
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nIn the sequel to SIFF 2023 Golden
  Space Needle Best Film winner Dancing Queen\, young hip-hop-dancing Mina 
 and her dance partner Markus head to Los Angeles in hopes of starring in a
  music video\, only for her to get the chance to be in a major motion pict
 ure! Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/dancing-queen-in-holly
 wood\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Mon 19 May\, 7
 :00 PM)
LOCATION:Shoreline CC Theater\, 16101 Greenwood Avenue North
END:VEVENT
