DTEND:20250521T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20250521T033000Z
UID:cMCevkVBlb
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nA Ukrainian family on vacation i
 n the Canary Islands suddenly find themselves stranded upon Russia’s inv
 asion of their home country\, sending them into fits of desperation and in
 trospection as they wander the beaches speculating what comes next.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/under-the-volcano\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SI
 FF Cinema Downtown (Fri 16 May\, 3:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
